     │
Monitored

Each stage SHALL remain independently auditable.

15. Distribution Governance

Every workflow distribution SHALL define:

Distribution authority
Source repository
Target environments
Applicable workflow versions
Applicable policy baseline
Approval requirements
Audit requirements

Governance SHALL accompany every workflow distribution.

16. Distribution Quality

Every workflow distribution SHALL satisfy:

Authenticity
Integrity
Compatibility
Completeness
Traceability
Recoverability
Auditability
Reproducibility

Quality SHALL be continuously monitored.

17. Conformance

A Workflow Distribution implementation conforms if it:

Distributes canonical workflow artifacts.
Verifies integrity before activation.
Preserves workflow identity.
Supports synchronization.
Implements governed deployment strategies.
Maintains distribution traceability.
Preserves governance metadata.
18. Future Evolution

